"Earth is contractually obligated to deal with one or two demons a year."
"All of them land in a controlled zone on Anesidora."
"A few hundred Avowed demolish each demon in seconds."
"No media are allowed, so the semi-annual event makes only a minor headline."
"The demon appears in an offshore facility, destroyed by a select battle group."
"The battle group spends several weeks away preparing; locals mostly care who is involved."
